{"attack":"如果击中，爆裂的火焰会攻击到对手。爆裂出的火焰还会飞溅到旁边的对手。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害。在双打对战、三打对战和皇家对战中，目标两侧的宝可梦会受到溅射伤害，损失最大ＨＰ的1⁄16。如果烈焰溅射没有命中、被守住或者攻击无效，不会出现溅射伤害。\n因为溅射伤害与属性无关，所以拥有引火、变色等特性的宝可梦受到溅射伤害时不能发动特性。溅射伤害可以不受守住、广域防守、挺住、神奇守护、替身、同命、心灵感应、破格的效果影响，但不能突破魔法防守特性。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Pansear","Level":22},{"Name":"Simisear","Level":0}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Charmander","Charmeleon","Charizard","Vulpix","Ninetales","Growlithe","Arcanine","Magmar","Cyndaquil","Quilava","Typhlosion","Slugma","Magcargo","Magby","Torchic","Combusken","Blaziken","Electrike","Manectric","Numel","Camerupt","Torkoal","Stunky","Skuntank","Magmortar","Victini","Litwick","Lampent","Chandelure","Heatmor","Salandit","Salazzle","Blacephalon"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}